- Tempo & Pulse: 140–160 BPM; rapid-fire chiptune tick-meters and jagged polyrhythms that suddenly collapse into lumbering, half-time hydraulic stomps and erratic galvanic stutter.
- Harmonic Palette: Locrian and Phrygian modes drenched in cold minor thirds, sharp microtonal drifts caused by modeled water pressure, and mutated major-key 8-bit arpeggios that turn violently dystopian under extreme pitch modulation.
- Production Signatures: Hydro-bitcrushing (downsampling square waves through acoustic convolution models of deep-sea trenches), Helium-Carrier Vocoding (routing vocal formants through raw Ricoh 2A03 audio chips run through analog dive-suit comm filters), and Telemetry-Sidechaining (punishing low-end ducking triggered by bursts of raw undersea packet noise).
- Dynamics: Abrupt tectonic shifts—silent, pressurized oceanic voids punctuated only by ticking tracker clocks, detonating without warning into deafening geysers of distorted square-wave noise and screaming robotic vocoders.

